# For local dev, leave this unset - App.jsx falls back to http://localhost:8001.
# For the real deployment, set VITE_API_BASE in Vercel's project settings
# (Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables) to the backend's public URL.
# For a local override without touching Vercel, copy this file to .env.local
# (already gitignored by the Vite template) and uncomment the line below.

# VITE_API_BASE=https://api.yourdomain.com
